{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y部分段落的感受提示略显密集和重复，尤其S06、S07，容易让观众觉得音乐已经被解释得很满，X在留白方面稍好。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y把叙事拆成了更容易扫读的短句，【】突出每段真正重要的心理变化，观众即使没有读过原文，也比较容易抓住人物此刻在想什么、为什么会这样。更重要的是，感受提示按音乐出现的时点展开，不只是罗列情绪，而是呈现从愤怒、怀念、失落到重新站稳的变化，音乐细节和人物经历能够互相解释。X的左右分栏也有直观优势，但右侧感受词经常集中堆叠，缺少明确的先后关系，观众不容易判断哪些是关键转折、哪些只是短暂的音乐色彩。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "99823fb9-5a7e-40ec-986e-f17bccd274f8", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T213646523624Z", "elapsed_seconds": 67.921, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T21:37:54.463791+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "4744fd613dbc391966cc68d5157b142c4029824c9c2ee6387f5cc0bd5d800130", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "too